<title>DUBAI: Bosnia's Izetbegovic goes to Saudi for pilgrimage.</title>
<headline>Bosnia's Izetbegovic goes to Saudi for pilgrimage.</headline>
<dateline>DUBAI 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alija Izetbegovic, the Moslem chairman of the Bosnian collective presidency, performed the minor Umra pilgrimage in Saudi Arabia late on Thursday, the official Saudi news agency SPA said.</p>
<p>SPA did not say when Izetbegovic had arrived or when he was due to depart.</p>
<p>The Umra, which takes just over an hour to complete, can be performed at any time of the year.</p>
</text>
